.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt CAPABILITIES 7
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm capabilities
.Nd privilege model notes for raw hardware access
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Substrate currently enforces raw hardware access primarily through effective
user identity checks rather than a full capability bitmap.
.Pp
Operations such as opening or using
.Pa /dev/port
are reserved to effective UID 0.
The manual page name is retained because the privilege boundary is part of the
kernel driver model contract and may evolve into finer-grained capabilities
later.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr port 4 ,
.Xr devfs_permissions 9
